{"about_the_game":"Before Alphadia I, the world was torn by the Energi War\u2014fueled by humanity's lust for life energy. In the midst of it, an energi clone named Alfonso begins to question everything. With nothing but his doubts and determination, he sets off on a journey to uncover meaning in a world consumed by power. What truth awaits at the end of his path?<br><br>Alphadia III returns with deep turn-based combat, SP Skills to shift the tide of battle, and new mechanics like Arrays and the Energi Crock system. Upgrade your ship into a seaplane, trade Energi Elements, and dive into missions, arenas, and more\u2014all wrapped in charming pixel graphics and a beautiful fantasy RPG adventure.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818380/extras/8456122daa682143d812bd78de416ddb.avif?t=1756859002\" width=730 height=182 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818380/extras/e63aaa7c4e98d83927d9b1401d4d1873.poster.avif?t=1756859002\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818380/extras/e63aaa7c4e98d83927d9b1401d4d1873.webm?t=1756859002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818380/extras/e63aaa7c4e98d83927d9b1401d4d1873.mp4?t=1756859002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A time before Alphadia I\u2014<br>As people sought the life energy known as &quot;energi&quot;, their desires clashed, igniting the Energi War...<br>Amidst the chaos, there was an energi clone who questioned the war.<br>His name was Alfonso.<br>&quot;Take action over worrying, believe in oneself and carve out your fate...&quot;<br>What will he discover at the end of his long journey?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818380/extras/99ac9b65913852d073ffb3d6d7c50ae8.avif?t=1756859002\" width=730 height=182 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818380/extras/f375a99d93d7dc918349f4f178726759.poster.avif?t=1756859002\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818380/extras/f375a99d93d7dc918349f4f178726759.webm?t=1756859002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818380/extras/f375a99d93d7dc918349f4f178726759.mp4?t=1756859002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Energi Crock</h2>Put unused items in this crock during your journey to create Energi Elements.<br>Energi Elements can be exchanged for items at the exchange shop.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Arrays</h2>Utilizing different Arrays expands your strategic options.<br>Some Arrays have unique acquisition methods...?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 SP Skills</h2>Filling the SP gauge allows you to unleash SP Skills.<br>These abilities will surely help turn the tide of battle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818380/extras/4c5dc65a16d7a6481ac77ee7e365df93.avif?t=1756859002\" width=730 height=182 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818380/extras/a294a3ea6a2cf858f05bb3361e5b85da.poster.avif?t=1756859002\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818380/extras/a294a3ea6a2cf858f05bb3361e5b85da.webm?t=1756859002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818380/extras/a294a3ea6a2cf858f05bb3361e5b85da.mp4?t=1756859002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Upgrade your ship into a seaplane during your journey!<br>It even has shops on board.<br><br>Includes classic features like missions and the arena!<br>Explore the vast world of Alphadia with beautiful pixel graphics!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3818380?t=1756859002","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818380/bfb3795d227019031e2301b20333e69045b49e64/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756859002","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818380/5240132cccdfece229ca9f09dca6d550060afa5d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756859002","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818380/5240132cccdfece229ca9f09dca6d550060afa5d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756859002","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"Before Alphadia I, the world was torn by the Energi War\u2014fueled by humanity's lust for life energy. In the midst of it, an energi clone named Alfonso begins to question everything. With nothing but his doubts and determination, he sets off on a journey to uncover meaning in a world consumed by power. What truth awaits at the end of his path?<br><br>Alphadia III returns with deep turn-based combat, SP Skills to shift the tide of battle, and new mechanics like Arrays and the Energi Crock system. Upgrade your ship into a seaplane, trade Energi Elements, and dive into missions, arenas, and more\u2014all wrapped in charming pixel graphics and a beautiful fantasy RPG adventure.<br><br><span class=